      "id": "13975",
      "body": "The images are uploaded in a folder with a strict naming convention:\n\n![\"image-20260824-035841.png\"](https://media-cdn.atlassian.com/file/71bda604-c560-4707-935b-d495f8f290f6/image/cdn?allowAnimated=true&client=a1e0a5de-9b66-4530-94e3-04447a6fdcb3&collection=&height=125&max-age=2592000&mode=full-fit&source=mediaCard&token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..RMddBvV1RrmxftSF7I32sO8opAfUtlSYMtATiUpGViQ&width=797#media-blob-url=true&id=71bda604-c560-4707-935b-d495f8f290f6&clientId=a1e0a5de-9b66-4530-94e3-04447a6fdcb3&contextId=&collection=)\n\nThen they end up in magento like\n\n\n![\"image-20260824-035901.png\"](image-20260824-035901.png)\n\n\n\nThe naming of the images drives the ordering of the gallery but also assigns the right tags:\n\n#1 - base/small/ thumbnail\n\n#2 - model\n\n#3 - product styling / size\n\n#6 - swatch",
