      "body": "User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d I am approving this, but just wanted to flag regarding the styling image. We have ended up with 2 x Shop the Look components. The larger component is to be used when a Campaign or Runway image is available for the shop the look image. The smaller component will be used when just the photo studio styling image is available. We just need to make sure we cover off a solution for both of these instances.",
